## Hints for Future Agents
Keep the exact public sentence Image exceeds the decoded pixel limit. Only status 413 may expose it. A prefixed diagnostic message must remain private, and the existing Unsupported video media allowlist behavior must stay unchanged. The HTTP-only fixture reuses the existing mock-server lifecycle with file discovery, TCP, and ZMQ events, so selected tests run without outer conftests or external NATS/etcd services. On macOS, run each HTTP case in a fresh process with -p no:forked.

## Codebase Discoveries
Pillow raises DecompressionBombError during Image.open, before a post-open max_pixels check can run. Catching at the common open boundary covers inline, fetched, and shared-cache bytes and preserves the existing batch error precedence. Unary Dynamo errors use a flat message/type/code object, while SSE nests the error and uses invalid_request_error as its type. The existing HTTP renderer mechanism is already on the upstream base through PR 18343.

